    {
      "id": 184011,
      "name": "LewdDolphin21",
      "username": "LewdDolphin21",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lewddolphin21/{size}/1893_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-11-01T01:43:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had a surprisingly fast game, winning in only three rounds. The start is setup for Tachyon to get Chaos Lord by blinking, and Chaos Lord loves cards like Pushing the Limits, Oblivion, and Proportionist (to increase Sky-Scraper's huge power). By her third turn she had 10 bursts in her trash and two Lightspeed Barrages in her hand, and that and the 3-4 Oblivion (which gave Nightmist The Indiscriminate) and a Synaptic Interruption caused Kaargra to flip in the same turn that she entered play, as well as add an amusingly high number of tokens to the hero favor pool, winning us the game.</p><p>Meanwhile, Visionary had fun using Turmoil on the Title Deck, and Wraith ended up being a non-damage dealer, due to using Infrared Eyepieces her first turn and not being able to deal damage due to Ashclaw R'velos on her second.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:09:18.888Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
