      "created_at": "2016-11-01T11:44:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This one was a lot of fun. Title control was key as usual (well, that and Dark Vis keeping Kaargra from ever showing up), and my only mistake was not counting card plays right; Tachyon could have been the Champion, which would have won me the game one attack sooner! :V</p>",
