    {
      "id": 184013,
      "name": "Reverend Pete",
      "username": "Reverend_Pete",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-11-01T13:53:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Missed my first shot, due to something I hadn't realized before....</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When calculating sources of damage for Mindbreaker, each of Sky-Scraper's sizes counts as a different character card. I was at 19 favor, and was counting on winning by Sky-Scraper taking damage from other heroes, but I changed sizes on Sky-Scraper's turn, and the game tracked two different streams for Sky-Scraper's damage sources. She ended up with 2 sources for one size (huge), and then 3 sources for another&nbsp;size (normal). I was surprised and saddened when she didn't pick up Mindbreaker for the win, and then I promptly got stomped on Kaargra's turn.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here goes try #2!&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:09:19.017Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
