      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lewddolphin21/{size}/1893_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-11-01T21:53:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>After thinking a little bit about my fast game yesterday, I realized the only bloodsworn points came from Kaargra doing damage after flipping. Since I had revealed a Get Back In There and had put that on top of the deck (at the time it seemed like a better play than Orrim Hiveminded), I tried again and put the latter on top this time. I ended up winning with Kaargra never flipping and 0 bloodsworn favor. The gladiators were really bad at their jobs, I suppose.</p><p>![](upload://99sG3zeA8NmxmdF22pUhgwyid96.jpeg)</p>",
