      "name": "McBehrer",
      "username": "McBehrer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-11-02T01:45:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This was a really tough Mint for me. Kaargra came out early, but she was taken care of, and we were all set up to win, with us at 19 and them at 11 or so…</p>\n<p>But i forgot that she flips if you kill all the gladiators. Then she also played Fickle Fans again, and a Bloodsworn Judgement, giving her Mindbreaker. In the end, it was 27 to 18, with Wraith and Tachyon down. (Tachyon only because she had Death Caller, and I forgot about this when I decided to keep Pushing the Limits.)</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:09:19.632Z",
