    {
      "id": 184022,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-11-02T02:33:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint. &nbsp;I let Kaargra come out even though she didn't really have to, reasoning that it was better for her to come out early on then it was for her to come out later when I was about to win. &nbsp;Then Sky-Scraper proceeded to win all the titles, and then 2 Lightspeed Barrages for 6 each brought Kaargra down, and Wraith finished her off.</p><p>Tachyon didn't have nearly enough cards in hand. &nbsp;When Chaos Lord flipped a Lightning Reflexes while I had one in hand I had the opportunity to play 5 cards (that includes the first Lightning Reflexes) during Tachyon's Start of Turn, with an option of 3 more during her actual play phase. &nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
