      "created_at": "2016-11-06T22:09:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Won with 20 - 8 in my favor. Used Vis to bury a Get Back In There, so Kaargra never flipped. Tachyon had Chaos Lord, Nightmist earned the Indiscriminate and a voatload of fabor when I threw an Oblivion spell.</p>\n<p>The Cactus earned the Stone jaw title. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
